pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# FH1-only real-render cadence prototype; no completed-frame synthesis.
# expect-performance 50000 55 20 70
# Real 60 means distinct title-rendered frames, not repeated presents.
# expect-distinct-presentation 55
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 780 0000 0 255 0 0 0 0
capture 900 drive-start
capture 1200 drive-mid
capture 1500 drive-end
input 1560 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1740 settled
stop 1770
